   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Carved Windows Survey</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Unity and Variety in Chinese Carved Windows\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Chen, Hu, Wang, Chen, Whitfield, Suhaimi & Zahari (2025), Buildings 15(24):4557, using the authors' own questionnaires and ten drawn Chinese carved windows from their OSF materials. Each participant is assigned to one image set (windows alone, or the same windows in a Chinese or a Western building background) and rates each window on nine statements about beauty, unity and variety.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"windows\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"intro\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I have read the information about the project and agree that the researchers may use my answers.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"Agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"Disagree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"title\": \"Age:\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"design_background\",\n      \"title\": \"Do you have a design background?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"What is your gender?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"condition\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"image_set\",\n      \"title\": \"Image set shown (assigned at random by the page)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Windows alone (Study 1)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Windows in a Chinese background (Study 2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Windows in a Western background (Study 2)\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"ratings\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"custom\",\n      \"name\": \"ratings\",\n      \"title\": \"Ratings of the ten carved windows\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"One row per image (key = window number w01…w10, the same window in every image set). Value { beautiful, attractive, pleasing, unified, coherent, orderly, parts, variety, rich }: each 1 = Strongly disagree … 7 = Strongly agree. Aesthetic preference = mean of beautiful, attractive, pleasing; unity = mean of unified, coherent, orderly; variety = mean of parts, variety, rich. Images: windows/w01–w10 (alone), cn01–cn10 (Chinese background), we01–we10 (Western background); the participant sees the ten images of the one set recorded in image_set, in random order.\",\n      \"items\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"beautiful\",\n        \"text\": \"This is a beautiful window\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"attractive\",\n        \"text\": \"This is an attractive window\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"pleasing\",\n        \"text\": \"This window is pleasing to see\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"unified\",\n        \"text\": \"This is a unified window\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"coherent\",\n        \"text\": \"This is a coherent window\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"orderly\",\n        \"text\": \"This is an orderly window\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"parts\",\n        \"text\": \"This window is made of different parts\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"variety\",\n        \"text\": \"This window conveys variety\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"rich\",\n        \"text\": \"This window is rich in elements\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f4f1ec;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f1b16;--muted:#625a50;--accent:#7a4a24;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#ddd5ca;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0 0 10px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:120px}\n.pic{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px}\n.pic img{max-width:100%;max-height:min(42vh,420px);object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.it{margin-top:12px}.it>div:first-child{font-weight:500}\n.sc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px;margin-top:4px}\n.sc button{font:inherit;padding:7px 0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}\n.sc button.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n.legend{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);columns:2;margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:18px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n@media (max-width:520px){.legend{columns:1}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Window drawings and questionnaire: Chen, Hu, Wang, Chen, Whitfield, Suhaimi &amp; Zahari (2025), Buildings 15(24):4557, doi:10.3390/buildings15244557, OSF materials. Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='carvedwin2025:', SETS=['w','cn','we'];\n  var ITEMS=[['beautiful','This is a beautiful {x}'],['attractive','This is an attractive {x}'],['pleasing','This {x} is pleasing to see'],\n    ['unified','This is a unified {x}'],['coherent','This is a coherent {x}'],['orderly','This is an orderly {x}'],\n    ['parts','This {x} is made of different parts'],['variety','This {x} conveys variety'],['rich','This {x} is rich in elements']];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, done={}, order=[], set=0;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){\n    app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn)+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;\n  }\n  function radios(n){return (q(n).choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('');}\n  function val(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');return x?Number(x.value):null;}\n  function noun(){return set===0?'window':'design';}\n  function img(k){return files[SETS[set]+k.slice(1)+'.jpg'];}\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    if(!ans.howto)return howto();\n    for(var i=0;i<order.length;i++){if(!done[order[i]])return rate(i);}\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    var miss=[];SETS.forEach(function(s){for(var i=1;i<=10;i++){var n=s+(i<10?'0':'')+i+'.jpg';if(!files[n])miss.push(n);}});\n    if(miss.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder windows must hold w01–w10, cn01–cn10 and we01–we10 (.jpg). Missing: '+esc(miss.join(', '))+'</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Unity and Variety in Chinese Architectural Aesthetics</h1>'+\n      '<p>You are being invited to take this survey. You will be shown a series of images. Each image carries a set of statements and rating scales that you will use for your assessment; please rate each image based on your first impression of its appearance. It takes about 8 minutes.</p>'+\n      '<p>Participation is voluntary and you may stop at any time until you submit the survey. We are not asking for any details that can identify you, so your responses are anonymous. We do not see any risks associated with this project, but if you do experience any issues, please stop taking the survey.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true],['image_set',set+1]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function about(){\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><b>'+esc(q('age').title)+'</b><input type=\"number\" name=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"99\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('design_background').title)+'</b>'+radios('design_background')+'</div><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('gender').title)+'</b>'+radios('gender')+'</div></div>','Continue',function(){\n      var a=Number((app.querySelector('input[name=age]')||{}).value);if(!a||a<16||a>99)return err('Please enter your age in years.');\n      var d=val('design_background');if(!d)return err('Please answer: '+q('design_background').title);\n      var g=val('gender');if(!g)return err('Please answer: '+q('gender').title);\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['age',a],['design_background',d],['gender',g]],b,function(){ans.about=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function howto(){\n    page('<h1>Rating the images</h1><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"color:var(--ink)\">You will see ten images, one at a time. For each image, please read each statement carefully and choose the number that best reflects your true level of agreement. This survey uses a 7-point scale:</p>'+\n      '<ol class=\"legend\"><li>Strongly disagree</li><li>Disagree</li><li>Somewhat disagree</li><li>Neutral / Neither agree nor disagree</li><li>Somewhat agree</li><li>Agree</li><li>Strongly agree</li></ol>'+\n      '<p style=\"margin-top:10px\">There are no right or wrong answers. Please respond based on your honest opinion and immediate reaction to each statement.</p></div>','Begin',function(){ans.howto=true;save('howto',true);next();});\n  }\n  function rate(i){\n    var k=order[i], f=img(k), n=0, v={};order.forEach(function(x){if(done[x])n++;});\n    var rows=ITEMS.map(function(it){var b='';for(var s=1;s<=7;s++)b+='<button type=\"button\" data-d=\"'+it[0]+'\" data-v=\"'+s+'\">'+s+'</button>';\n      return '<div class=\"it\"><div>'+esc(it[1].replace('{x}',noun()))+'</div><div class=\"sc\">'+b+'</div><div class=\"ends\"><span>1 = Strongly disagree</span><span>7 = Strongly agree</span></div></div>';}).join('');\n    page('<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Image '+(n+1)+' of '+order.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*n/order.length)+'%\"></i></div></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Drawing of a Chinese carved window'+(set===1?' in a Chinese building background':set===2?' in a Western building background':'')+'\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+rows,'Next',function(){\n      for(var j=0;j<ITEMS.length;j++)if(!v[ITEMS[j][0]])return err('Please answer: '+ITEMS[j][1].replace('{x}',noun()));\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;\n      SPSite.answer('ratings',v,{key:k,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}done[k]=true;next();});\n    });\n    app.querySelectorAll('.sc button').forEach(function(x){x.onclick=function(){v[x.dataset.d]=Number(x.dataset.v);\n      app.querySelectorAll('.sc button[data-d=\"'+x.dataset.d+'\"]').forEach(function(y){y.classList.toggle('on',y===x);});hideErr();};});\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>The images showed ten Chinese carved windows drawn by the researchers, either on their own or placed in a Chinese or a Western building background; each participant saw one of these sets. In the original studies with 797 participants in Guangzhou, unity and variety were negatively correlated yet both went with higher aesthetic preference, unity more strongly, and the stylistically mismatched Western background lowered perceived unity and raised perceived variety.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Drawings and questionnaire: Chen, S., Hu, Y., Wang, Y., Chen, Y., Whitfield, A., Suhaimi, S. N., &amp; Zahari, Z. A. (2025). Unity and variety in architecture: Investigation from elements to compositions in aesthetic preferences. Buildings 15(24):4557, doi:10.3390/buildings15244557. Used with credit and removed if the authors object.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){\n      if(x==='consent'||x==='image_set')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='ratings')done={};else ans.about=false;});next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    var spec={pages:[]};try{spec=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){}\n    spec.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={title:g.title||e.title,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('windows')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    var s=a.image_set?a.image_set-1:load('set');if(s!==0&&s!==1&&s!==2)s=Math.floor(Math.random()*3);set=s;save('set',set);\n    var keys=[];for(var i=1;i<=10;i++)keys.push('w'+(i<10?'0':'')+i);\n    var o=load('order');if(!o||o.length!==10||o.some(function(x){return keys.indexOf(x)<0;}))o=shuffle(keys);order=o;save('order',order);\n    ((a.ratings&&a.ratings.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===true;ans.about=a.gender!=null;ans.howto=!!load('howto')||Object.keys(done).length>0;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
